================================================================================
ORIGINAL WORK (© VaaniEdge / IISc CI Lab)
================================================================================
All engine, DSP, codec, agent and UI code under the Kotlin package `in.iisc.vaani.*`
and the native library `app/src/main/cpp/vaani_dsp_neon.cpp`, plus the host-side
pipeline in `speech_lab/`, is original first-principles work:

  * libvaani_dsp_neon.so   — custom C++17 ARM64 NEON DSP (pre-emphasis, RMS,
                             Whisper-exact log-Mel spectrogram with a planned
                             mixed-radix FFT, Kaiser-sinc resampler, float->PCM16).
  * in.iisc.vaani.neural.* — ONNX Runtime inference engines (Silero VAD, Whisper STT
                             with step-0 EN/HI language ID, KV-cache decoding and
                             logit-level script masking, VITS TTS) written directly
                             against the ai.onnxruntime API.
  * in.iisc.vaani.codec.*  — Hinglish Codec, Indic G2P (espeak-compatible rules
                             derived and scored in speech_lab/verify_closed_loop.py),
                             ARPAbet->Devanagari converter.
  * in.iisc.vaani.llm.*    — streaming Groq/Gemini SSE client, clause-level TTS
                             pipelining, tool-tag parsing.
  * in.iisc.vaani.tools.*, agent.*, audio.*, runtime.*, ui.* — tools, orchestration,
                             capture/playback and the Compose UI.

